  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Once the fcrepo-upgrde-utils skeleton is ready, this task is to add support for transforming WebAC representation from 4.7 format to 5.x format.  This will involve at the very least: ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Merging group of authorizations associated with a 4.7.x style ACL into a single resource named fcr:acl that lives under the resource had the original 4.7.x ACL defined on it.  ",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
