  "description": "<p>Once the fcrepo-upgrde-utils skeleton is ready, this task is to add support for transforming WebAC representation from 4.7 format to 5.x format.  This will involve at the very least: </p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Merging group of authorizations associated with a 4.7.x style ACL into a single resource named fcr:acl that lives under the resource had the original 4.7.x ACL defined on it.  </li>\n\t<li>Remove the triple on the  protected resource that linked it to the top of the ACL authorization hierarchy.</li>\n</ol>\n",
